&_nc_oc=AdoskglD9ThChV66KiU9hLxtMHzGgojXp_XNW_k4wGUZNh5mGtWp2b5tbjmvy3yoM5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLSe-x52-Cj-Mo35EcYAbp_eciaJlu3rbu6DiVVXnxyEg&oe=6AB27658"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_05_comfort_menu.png", "id": "2058621092196858", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307309_2058621095530191_366338629048714481_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XpOsE8E16nQQ7kNvwFpZsxk&_nc_oc=AdpGs7heLV19bAk4q49WkxEzU1q_23Soc735yxV_qUWbMWbiZ7v_xbT360snQKsOT9A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLE77WePDcQ1ZpMDCWFhh0xEVDmfZajxmuZuUp7ZiIuLw&oe=6AB2A6FC"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_01_coin_trail.png", "id": "888256780666510", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673780696_888256783999843_1367271276265712207_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M1-8YiIiml4Q7kNvwFFe07L&_nc_oc=Adr65sa4yTggomMKETNjeWswg76cclm20E8gKLcLcjQUsPzD7tl337jRpFs6Hf-2WuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJIxmqNsEqwIcr_iXc_aO-SIg5xd9-6R2OEnRJXrfIQUw&oe=6AB29E96"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_03_level_vista.png", "id": "1295268972503088", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_1295268975836421_9133143210799255965_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6BMva8cJLfEQ7kNvwHJVXvj&_nc_oc=Adrnlc2XS4QDa7ANkWCIM4hO8q3WATA8_4DorUzNZSg2n2ePzZ9Tm_uwbZhMIrcssp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIYki_-AmTQWMt8pZLf_N3wT-tLUBuv0aal6c-Mf7Ttvg&oe=6AB276DE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1602252444830748", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619681_1602252448164081_2145720626556957219_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FTp8ghQJOJIQ7kNvwF01Pre&_nc_oc=Adodj_gqWgAfWdvgtwpmVTnYAiU_bD8ebDWbZoiszHoJhvJwGWXj1aqZl05HsewlRXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJuxYynRj4b4bvBnab1d_VnoHWWOxRuoL3FliVL_tIrDw&oe=6AB28822"}, "display_name": "Nimbi's Adventures", "keywords": ["platformer", "family", "adventure"], "long_description": "THE BREAKOUT VR PLATFORMER OF THE YEAR\n\nRemember the first time a video game made you smile? Nimbi's Adventures brings that feeling back... except this time you are inside the world. Join Nimbi, an adorable white mushroom with a red polka-dot cap, on a third-person 3D platforming adventure built for Meta Quest. Every level feels like a life-size toy diorama: castles towering over you, pipes full of secrets, and waves sparkling beneath wooden piers.\n\nCLASSIC MECHANICS, BRAND-NEW FEELING\n- Run, jump and chain precise double jumps.\n- Attack enemies and smash breakable blocks full of surprises.\n- Collect regular and red coins: each one buzzes in your hand with haptic feedback.\n- Gather 60 coins to transform into GOLDEN NIMBI: your attack shatters blocks and defeats enemies in your path.\n\nTWO WORLDS TO EXPLORE\n- Hills: green meadows, castles and mysterious pipes.\n- Beach: wooden piers, warm sand and sparkling water.\n- Your progress is saved: clear the Hills to unlock the Beach.\n- Generous checkpoints and a goal flag to celebrate every victory.\n\nREAL VR COMFORT\n- Orbital camera with 30-degree snap turns: no continuous rotation, no queasiness.\n- Instant one-button recentering.\n- World-anchored HUD, never glued to your face.\n- Comfortable menus: just point with your controller.\n- Native 72-120 Hz on Meta Quest for constant smoothness.\n\nFUN FOR ALL AGES\nColorful, cheerful and easy to learn: a perfect first VR game, great for kids and for lifelong platformer fans alike. Classic platfor", "short_description": "Jump into a life-size toy world. Run, double-jump and go golden with Nimbi in a comfort-first third-person VR platformer made for Meta Quest.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/2f4ad790-50df-44e8-a18d-18378f51